1
00:00:42,159 --> 00:00:43,039
Teacher

2
00:00:43,039 --> 00:00:44,079
Teacher Danni

3
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:45,520
Teacher Danni, something's wrong!

4
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:47,079
Xiao Qi is planning on selling a kidney!

5
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:48,359
What?

6
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:49,600
I'll bring him back.

7
00:00:50,439 --> 00:00:51,280
Wait for me here.

8
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:52,240
I'm coming with you.

9
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:53,280
Stay here and wait for me.

10
00:00:53,320 --> 00:00:54,280
I'll bring him back safely.

11
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:54,840
But I...

12
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:55,439
Don't worry.

13
00:00:57,799 --> 00:00:58,520
Brother Qiang.

14
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:00,840
Need some help?

15
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:02,920
I'll handle my own business.

16
00:01:03,719 --> 00:01:05,040
You be careful out there!

17
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:30,640
Who let you in here?

18
00:01:30,959 --> 00:01:31,840
Who the hell are you?

19
00:01:45,439 --> 00:01:46,159
Hey, boss, boss!

20
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:47,000
Wait a sec.

21
00:01:48,519 --> 00:01:50,000
He signed the contract himself.

22
00:01:50,159 --> 00:01:51,640
He's the one who insisted on selling a kidney.

23
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:53,359
He needed the money.

24
00:01:53,480 --> 00:01:54,359
It's none of my business.

25
00:01:54,439 --> 00:01:55,400
I just run a business.

26
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:04,079
I'm young and naive.

27
00:02:04,079 --> 00:02:05,120
Take care, I won't see you out.

28
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:07,000
Thanks for letting me off!

29
00:02:07,959 --> 00:02:09,159
Who forced you into selling a kidney?

30
00:02:09,919 --> 00:02:10,520
I...

31
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:12,680
My sister...

32
00:02:13,039 --> 00:02:13,960
What happened to A Fen?

33
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:16,000
She's with Elephant.

34
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:17,360
She's being held at the nightclub.

35
00:02:17,639 --> 00:02:18,319
Money.

36
00:02:18,599 --> 00:02:19,439
I need money.

37
00:02:19,879 --> 00:02:21,400
With money, I can save my sister.

38
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:23,199
Don't be afraid. Take your time.

39
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:25,400
What happened?

40
00:02:28,759 --> 00:02:31,039
To save up for Dad's medical bills,

41
00:02:31,919 --> 00:02:33,080
she borrowed from a loan shark.

42
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:34,800
Compound interest just kept piling up.

43
00:02:48,479 --> 00:02:50,400
Why do you look like you've seen a ghost?

44
00:02:52,639 --> 00:02:53,560
Brother...

45
00:02:53,919 --> 00:02:56,159
Just give me two more days.

46
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,840
I promise, within two days,

47
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:59,240
I'll pay back every cent.

48
00:02:59,599 --> 00:03:00,520
You borrow, you pay.

49
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:01,639
That's the rule.

50
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:03,759
Your dad's that sick,

51
00:03:03,759 --> 00:03:05,120
and I only came collecting today.

52
00:03:05,199 --> 00:03:06,840
That's me being mighty decent, right?

53
00:03:06,919 --> 00:03:07,400
But...

54
00:03:07,719 --> 00:03:08,639
But I've already...

55
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:10,719
I've already paid back so much.

56
00:03:11,639 --> 00:03:12,919
How much have you actually paid?

57
00:03:12,919 --> 00:03:14,280
You should know deep down.

58
00:03:18,719 --> 00:03:20,319
You signed the contract yourself.

59
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:22,080
And now you wanna weasel out?

60
00:03:25,919 --> 00:03:26,400
Don't!

61
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:27,240
Don't!

62
00:03:27,479 --> 00:03:28,560
Why so tense?

63
00:03:29,039 --> 00:03:30,479
You really care about these plates, huh?

64
00:03:30,919 --> 00:03:32,120
Don't!

65
00:03:35,479 --> 00:03:36,759
Brother...

66
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:38,439
Brother, I'm begging you.

67
00:03:38,439 --> 00:03:39,199
Stop smashing them.

68
00:03:39,479 --> 00:03:41,319
Really, if you break them, I have to pay.

69
00:03:41,319 --> 00:03:42,560
Brother, stop smashing them.

70
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:44,680
Stop smashing them.

71
00:03:48,639 --> 00:03:49,840
Why are you working yourself up so much?

72
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:51,120
What for?

73
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:53,919
We all understand your dad's situation.

74
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:55,280
We're all human.

75
00:03:56,599 --> 00:03:59,120
Giving you a few more days isn't impossible.

76
00:04:00,159 --> 00:04:01,000
Really?

77
00:04:01,199 --> 00:04:02,000
Really?

78
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,599
Thank you, thank you, Brother.

79
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:04,479
Thank you.

80
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:04,879
Here's the deal.

81
00:04:04,879 --> 00:04:05,680
Thank you, thank you.

82
00:04:06,319 --> 00:04:07,759
I'll take you to meet my boss.

83
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:09,599
If you keep him happy,

84
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:11,080
he might just wipe your debt clean.

85
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:18,120
No.

86
00:04:18,519 --> 00:04:19,240
I won't go.

87
00:04:19,240 --> 00:04:20,360
I won't go.

88
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:29,439
Don't break them!

89
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:31,240
Don't break them!

90
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:32,879
Brother...

91
00:04:32,879 --> 00:04:33,519
I'm sorry.

92
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:34,040
Brother, I'm begging you.

93
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:35,759
I beg you, tell them to stop smashing.

94
00:04:35,879 --> 00:04:37,480
I have to pay for whatever gets broken.

95
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:40,240
Brother, stop, stop smashing.

96
00:04:42,319 --> 00:04:42,839
I...

97
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:45,040
I'll go with you, I'll go.

98
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:48,040
Move.

99
00:04:48,279 --> 00:04:49,639
Come on, move.

100
00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:51,360
Move.

101
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:53,240
Get moving.

102
00:04:58,199 --> 00:05:00,519
What are you doing, Loan Shark King?

103
00:05:00,519 --> 00:05:02,199
This ain't right.

104
00:05:02,199 --> 00:05:04,319
Be gentle with her.

105
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:05,800
I didn't mean to, boss.

106
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:07,439
I just don't know my own strength.

107
00:05:09,079 --> 00:05:10,800
A Fen, right?

108
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:13,959
You're quite pretty.

109
00:05:14,279 --> 00:05:16,480
You're even prettier than your photo.

110
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:18,639
Come here.

111
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:20,519
Did you get hurt?

112
00:05:20,519 --> 00:05:21,920
Dragged back, huh.

113
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:25,720
Let me rub some medicinal wine on you.

114
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:28,399
Come, come.

115
00:05:28,399 --> 00:05:30,040
Sit here.

116
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:32,720
How did you end up like this?

117
00:05:33,399 --> 00:05:34,920
In so much debt.

118
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:38,160
The interest on this is brutal, you know.

119
00:05:38,279 --> 00:05:38,959
Brother Elephant.

120
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:39,800
Brother Elephant, Brother Elephant.

121
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:42,279
I'll work hard to pay you back.

122
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:46,519
Work hard, keep pushing.

123
00:05:47,199 --> 00:05:50,839
Delivering goods and washing dishes,

124
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:53,439
just to make a few hundred a day.

125
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:55,600
Working yourself to the bone.

126
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:57,519
What's the point?

127
00:06:00,639 --> 00:06:01,800
Look at your hands.

128
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:05,040
They're all blistered.

129
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:06,160
Does it hurt?

130
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,680
Let me tell you,

131
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:15,800
You'll never pay it off like this.

132
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:18,240
Why not stay with me?

133
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:20,279
I love your type the most,

134
00:06:20,279 --> 00:06:22,199
an inexperienced virgin.

135
00:06:22,199 --> 00:06:23,560
Brother Elephant, I don't do that kind of thing.

136
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:25,040
Do you want your dad to run out of meds,

137
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:27,600
or your brother selling a kidney?

138
00:06:32,639 --> 00:06:33,439
Here's the deal.

139
00:06:35,319 --> 00:06:37,120
You spend one night with me,

140
00:06:37,839 --> 00:06:41,160
make me nice and comfortable,

141
00:06:41,639 --> 00:06:44,920
and we can easily settle your debt.

142
00:06:46,279 --> 00:06:47,079
Exactly.

143
00:06:47,199 --> 00:06:48,759
We're all adults here.

144
00:06:49,079 --> 00:06:50,800
One big happy family,

145
00:06:50,800 --> 00:06:52,680
Your whole family will be blessed.

146
00:06:54,439 --> 00:06:55,519
Brother, have a drink.

147
00:07:07,839 --> 00:07:09,079
Made up your mind?

148
00:07:12,399 --> 00:07:13,240
Get over here.

149
00:07:22,920 --> 00:07:23,839
On your knees.

150
00:07:34,480 --> 00:07:35,959
After this,

151
00:07:36,759 --> 00:07:42,360
my whole debt really gets wiped clean?

152
00:07:43,319 --> 00:07:44,920
Of course.

153
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:50,360
I, Brother Elephant, always keep my word.

154
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:53,000
Work hard, keep pushing.

155
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:25,480
What are you crying for?

156
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:27,839
Weren't you just fine a moment ago?

157
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:33,440
Everything I was supposed to do,

158
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:35,240
I've done it all.

159
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:40,360
So my debt to you is wiped clean.

160
00:08:41,399 --> 00:08:42,360
Sure.

161
00:08:42,519 --> 00:08:45,320
I, Elephant, am a man of my word.

162
00:08:45,399 --> 00:08:47,720
The money I lent you is wiped clean.

163
00:08:50,879 --> 00:08:52,879
But the interest, of course,

164
00:08:52,879 --> 00:08:54,399
still has to be paid.

165
00:08:55,039 --> 00:08:56,600
You've had it for so long,

166
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:59,399
it adds up to quite a sum.

167
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:01,279
I'll have them do the math,

168
00:09:01,279 --> 00:09:03,000
and tell you the number tomorrow.

169
00:09:03,559 --> 00:09:05,679
That's not what you said just now.

170
00:09:08,919 --> 00:09:11,399
What I said from start to finish was:

171
00:09:11,399 --> 00:09:14,799
the money I lent you is wiped clean.

172
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:16,840
Who do you think you are?

173
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:19,120
Millions for one night in bed?

174
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:20,480
Are you made of gold?

175
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:23,639
Say that again.

176
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:26,840
Who do you think you are?

177
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:33,399
Why did you lie to me?

178
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:35,679
Why did you lie to me?

179
00:09:35,759 --> 00:09:37,480
That's not what you said just now.

180
00:09:37,480 --> 00:09:39,679
That's not what you said just now.

181
00:09:39,679 --> 00:09:40,840
Get away from me!

182
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:48,879
What's with all the crying?

183
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:50,440
You're a woman, after all.

184
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:52,080
Making money is easy for you, isn't it?

185
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:55,559
You've got the body,

186
00:09:55,559 --> 00:09:57,840
and the looks.

187
00:09:57,840 --> 00:10:01,240
And I just tried out your skills,

188
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:02,639
and they're not bad at all.

189
00:10:03,440 --> 00:10:04,519
Get lost!

190
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:10,279
You don't want your dad running out of meds,

191
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:12,799
and you want to pay off the debt soon.

192
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:15,960
I understand your devotion to your father.

193
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:18,799
Why not stay here and work for me?

194
00:10:20,879 --> 00:10:23,000
You won't have to lift a finger all day.

195
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:25,159
Just be a good girl,

196
00:10:26,799 --> 00:10:30,240
and men will line up to throw money at you.

197
00:10:30,240 --> 00:10:31,039
Right?

198
00:10:31,039 --> 00:10:33,679
Pay off your debt and have some fun too.

199
00:10:34,279 --> 00:10:35,440
Think about it.

200
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:48,480
Remember to clock in on time tomorrow!

201
00:11:25,480 --> 00:11:26,919
Sis, I'm home.

202
00:11:33,759 --> 00:11:36,639
How was your day

203
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:39,120
at school?

204
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:40,200
It was fine.

205
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:40,679
Sis.

206
00:11:40,679 --> 00:11:41,480
Here, drink some water.

207
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:43,440
I brought back some roast chicken from work.

208
00:11:43,759 --> 00:11:45,279
We're eating well tonight.

209
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:48,919
Xiao Qi, how many times have I told you?

210
00:11:49,320 --> 00:11:49,720
I mean it,

211
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:51,480
stop working at those places.

212
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:52,919
I can handle all this.

213
00:11:52,919 --> 00:11:54,159
Do you not understand?

214
00:11:54,159 --> 00:11:55,799
It's fine. I can manage.

215
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:58,279
Don't worry, Sis.

216
00:11:58,559 --> 00:12:00,159
My pay from the flower shop and the club

217
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:01,240
is coming through soon.

218
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:02,200
I did the math,

219
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:04,159
and it should cover Dad's next round of chemo.

220
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:07,919
Sis, you work way too hard.

221
00:12:08,159 --> 00:12:09,600
I have to help share the load.

222
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:11,039
Once I graduate,

223
00:12:11,039 --> 00:12:12,440
I can find a real job.

224
00:12:12,679 --> 00:12:13,320
By then,

225
00:12:13,320 --> 00:12:15,360
we won't have to work so hard.
